WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.531 --> 00:00:03.841
ROCKET
Why are we always getting involved

00:00:03.891 --> 00:00:05.452
in everyone else's troubles?

00:00:06.359 --> 00:00:07.138
[Laughter]

00:00:07.189 --> 00:00:09.434
PETER QUILL
Because we're the freaking Guardians of the Galaxy.

00:00:11.555 --> 00:00:15.974
(Crank up the volume
for the summer's biggest event.)

00:00:16.025 --> 00:00:17.410
GROOT
I am Groot.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:18.687
GAMORA
You're all just making up stuff

00:00:18.737 --> 00:00:19.650
that he's saying, right?

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.403
ROCKET
No!

00:00:23.748 --> 00:00:24.652
DRAX
Analogy.

00:00:24.948 --> 00:00:25.823
PETER QUILL
Is it?

00:00:29.043 --> 00:00:29.995
DRAX
Metaphor.

00:00:30.046 --> 00:00:30.876
MANTIS
Oh...

00:00:35.098 --> 00:00:36.189
PETER QUILL
If this is the end,

00:00:36.239 --> 00:00:37.784
may as well have
a little fun, huh?

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:38.842
DRAX
Yeah! [Laughing]

00:00:38.893 --> 00:00:40.848
♫ Hooked on a feelin' ♫

00:00:42.896 --> 00:00:43.635
MANTIS
Hello!

00:00:43.686 --> 00:00:44.641
[Screaming]

00:00:45.693 --> 00:00:46.714
PETER QUILL
Exactly!

00:00:49.445 --> 00:00:51.242
NEBULA
You left out some important information

00:00:51.293 --> 00:00:54.112
but, that is the gist of it.

00:00:54.163 --> 00:00:57.058
[Screaming]

00:00:57.109 --> 00:00:58.813
♫ Hooked on a feelin' ♫

00:01:00.469 --> 00:01:01.469
[Screaming]

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.294
MANTIS
I was screaming at something scary

00:01:03.344 --> 00:01:05.870
behind you, not you,
you look really cool.

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:06.786
LAMBSHANK
Thank you!

